    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d450">

                <pb facs="0538" n="426" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg426"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/991</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hartman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-18T17:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 18, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs informed me to-day that the Minister of Finance
                    unofficially informed him that on December 31 all money deposited interest
                    Guayaquil &amp; Quito Railway bonds will be placed to order Council of Foreign
                    Bondholders.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
